Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:24.65,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}踊ろうか眠ろうか
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:26.74,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}焦っているばかり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:31.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}苦労に育てられたけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:36.19,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}今はいらない　いつかは咲きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.33,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}右往左往の毎日も
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.65,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}これが routine life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.09,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}染みわたっていく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.99,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}开始慢节奏的生活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.25,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}这是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:30.25,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}渗透着方方面面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:47.22,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}睡前一杯热牛奶 什么都倒映不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.08,0:00:52.45,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}或许它挺香甜可口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:54.58,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}但这倒是其次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:55.87,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}该睡了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.87,0:01:01.63,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}感觉总也打不起精神来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:03.91,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}哦这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:08.38,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}原来不用那么累死累活也可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:12.44,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}那我应该可以放下心来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:16.19,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}我的人生真奇妙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:22.02,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}过着慢节奏的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:24.65,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}可我还是着急抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.65,0:01:26.74,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}该开心跳舞还是睡个好觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:31.57,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}虽然曾有过一段艰苦的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.57,0:01:36.19,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}但现在已不再 我想有一天开花结果
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.33,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}四处奔波的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.65,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}也是我的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.09,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)\3c&H6AA2C3&\bord6\blur8\3a&H45&\1a&HFF&}渗透着方方面面
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED1
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.28,0:22:43.31,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,捧げて　生きてる　意味わからないまま
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.85,0:22:49.32,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,もういいや　って　今日　なげだしてみよう
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.87,0:22:55.80,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,導き　いつもの　過ぎるだけの時間に
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.91,0:23:01.79,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,飽きてさ　ただ変わりたいだけだった
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.86,0:23:06.79,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,うつくしい　あなただけの世界　魅せて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.31,0:23:12.79,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}わたしのぜんぶを　届けたいよ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.39,0:23:19.54,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,祈りの欠片を　あつめて生きて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.85,0:23:29.27,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,美しくなんかなくていいよ　望んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.28,0:22:43.31,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,为别人奉献而生 却不知其意义
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.85,0:22:49.32,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,但 就这样吧 今天 就暂且忘掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.87,0:22:55.80,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,遵从既定的引导 从而度过的时间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.91,0:23:01.79,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,我早就厌了 我只想将其彻底改变
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.86,0:23:06.79,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,你的世界 是那么美 让我着迷
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.31,0:23:12.79,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,250)}我愿把我的一切 都献给你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.39,0:23:19.54,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,收集一片片破碎的祈祷 生活下去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.85,0:23:29.27,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,不需要有多么美 期望就好
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED2
